---
description: Thin Next.js delivery apps
globs: apps/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

`app/` is routing only. UI for a module lives in `src/features/<module>/`.
Shell nav is built from module manifests. Do not duplicate business rules in components.
`src/proxy.ts` is the Next.js 16 request interception file. Keep it to auth and tenant pre-checks.
Console and portal do not import each other. The worker does not import React.
